    "t": 4496.88,
    "title": "NEW EVIDENCE REVEALED: What No One Ever Told You About the Shroud of Turin w/Jeremiah J. Johnston",
    "video_id": "rVNc9Dlnj2A"
   },
   {
    "context": "S E S dot Edu. All right, friends, it's been great being with you. Jesus has risen. The evidence is there. The only question is, is your worldview or your own will gonna prevent you from accepting it? Because you're only gonna get two things in the afterlife. You're either gonna get grace or you're gonna get justice. I don't want justice. Do you? No, you want grace. That accept Jesus and join the family and let's make him great to the nations. Let's make disciples of all nations. All right, see you here next week. God bless.",
